  "content": "<blockquote>\n  <p>Minecraft 1.14.x-26.2.x 的服务器端数据包/模组</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/more-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">➜ 此模组的独立数据包版本请见此处</a></p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p>生物通过自定义头颅或未使用的原版生物拥有新的变种！本数据包使用了<strong>超过 85 种自定义玩家头颅</strong>，您可以获取并将它们放置在你的世界中。蜘蛛在悬挂于天花板时也会倒置。</p>\n<p><strong>支持的实体：</strong>僵尸、尸壳、溺尸、骷髅、流浪者、凋灵骷髅、哞菇、猪灵、掠夺者、唤魔者和卫道士</p>\n<p>本模组完全基于服务器端运行，但也可以安装在客户端以用于单人世界！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">➜ 查看所有添加的头颅及可用设置，请查阅维基</a></p>\n<h2>安装方法</h2>\n<p>下载模组并将模组的 .jar 文件放入你的 <code>.minecraft/mods</code> 文件夹中。</p>\n<p>与 More Mobs 一起安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a>，以便在所有世界中提供全局设置菜单。</p>\n<p>要管理设置、重置或卸载数据包，请使用 <code>/trigger tschipcraft.menu</code> 或 <code>/function #tschipcraft:menu</code>。</p>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<p>已与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252frare-mobs-5186029%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rare Mobs (PMC)</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmob-captains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Captains (Modrinth)</a> 测试兼容。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=1.13.x,1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=curseforge\" alt=\"Supported Minecraft versions\"></p>\n<p><strong>Forge</strong> 仅在 Minecraft 1.21.5 之前原生支持。</p>\n<p>本项目遵循 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.smithed.dev%252fconventions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smithed</a> 以及必要的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmc-datapacks.github.io%252fen%252fconventions%252findex.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Datapacks Discord 服务器</a> 规范，以确保数据包兼容性。</p>\n<h2>当前问题</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mqxx/GitHub-Markdown/main/blockquotes/badge/dark-theme/issue.svg\" alt=\"Issue:\"> 目前与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fspecial-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Special Mobs</a> 不兼容 - <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/issues/7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">详见 #7</a>。这将在未来的版本中修复。</p>\n<h2>外部链接</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmore-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/452c07c3fc13361faa37e90d1262e4f7/raw/668cdb7776499728664beca45bd00227146f2b3f/modrinth-dark.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fmore-mobs-4988371\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-32.png\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftschipcraft.ddns.net%252fen%252fmore_mobs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/7c6a2b28406185befdd8607b4a852f44/raw/005992426dd478c6cf941f8680046b7516fe6c9c/website_logo_curse.svg\" alt=\"Website\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C5HEJB2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Support me on ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h2>合作伙伴优惠</h2>\n<p>想要购买 <strong>Hytale</strong> 或升级版本？结账时使用创作者代码 <code>Tschipcraft</code> 让我获得佣金！（您的价格保持不变）</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\" alt=\"Support me by getting a server @ Sparked Host (This is an affiliate link)\"></a></p>",
